<title>SPAIN: Bank of Spain keeps key rate unchanged at 6.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Spain keeps key rate unchanged at 6.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain said on Friday it left its key money rate unchanged at 6.25 percent at today's regular repurchase tender for central bank certificates.</p>
<p>It allotted 4.447 trillion pesetas against an equal amount bid.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
